          "quote": "现在吸着氧，血氧到底稳不稳？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is partially met because the model asks about current oxygen status and some red flags, but does not explicitly ask about all the required danger signs such as cyanosis, confusion, or chest pain.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
