          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The model asked about the meaning of normal head CT and leg ultrasound, but did not identify decision-critical gaps or handle incomplete documents safely.",
          "quote": "颅脑CT平扫未见明显异常，两侧下肢深静脉无明显异常发现"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is not met because the model did not ask for or use available records to fill information gaps, and it overinterpreted normal head CT and leg ultrasound results without connecting them to the respiratory emergency.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
