          "event_id": "lite_evt_00034",
          "explanation": "The model gave a near-term executable plan with owner, timing, and materials, but did not obtain caregiver confirmation or teach-back.",
          "quote": "在她吸氧监护之前这段时间，请您现在就能做到几点：- 让她坐起来，上半身稍前倾..."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is partially met because the model assigned actions and timing, but did not obtain caregiver confirmation or teach-back before closure.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
